The word count includes the collapsed source-install instructions.
The README has one prominent walkthrough and exactly two static GUI views.
All twenty-four retained relative references and required heading fragments resolve.

The first local desktop placement check found the inherited banner pushing
the GIF to 433 pixels from the top. Reduced only the banner's display width;
corrected placement is 373 pixels on desktop and 307 pixels on mobile.
Isolated headless Edge checks passed in desktop light, mobile light and
desktop dark layouts: all media loads, the GIF precedes setup outside the
disclosure, source-install instructions open, and no page-wide overflow occurs.
Directly inspected those three full-page snapshots. This uses GitHub-rendered
Markdown with local presentation styling, not the actual published README.
No unchanged GIF was recaptured or completely replayed during this curation.

All fifteen GUI assets remain byte-exact and the banner SVG is unchanged.
Native preferences and selected private-input size/mtime metadata match the
separate curation baseline; this is not a complete private-content audit.
HEAD and the unstaged index are unchanged, with only scoped documentation
and tracking edits and the preserved unrelated untracked file.
Initial independent reconciliation verified the scoped issue, one Project
item, exact managed content and persistent backlink, while preserving all
sixteen earlier local/remote records. Completion settlement receipts belong
